HST PDF: the toolbar button that opens the PDF in HST Draw reads "Sửa tệp PDF"; its tooltip and accessible
description say "Sửa trong HST Draw" (owner request 14/11/2026).

- xmlsecurity/uiconfig/ui/hstpdfviewer.ui: label "Edit PDF File", tooltip "Edit in HST Draw", accessible
  description "Edit in HST Draw" (the accessible name is the label).
- translations/source/vi/xmlsecurity/messages.po: "Sửa tệp PDF", "Sửa trong HST Draw" (tooltip and
  description).

